  <div class="calc-suite__intro"><div><span class="calc-hero__eyebrow">CCA toolkit</span><h2>Eight practical fitness calculators</h2></div><p>Results are estimates for healthy adults. Adjust with real progress over time and speak to a qualified clinician for medical guidance.</p></div>
