    <article class="fitness-calculator"><div class="fitness-calculator__head"><span class="fitness-calculator__icon">◉</span><div><h3>BMI & healthy range</h3><p>Screen your weight relative to height.</p></div></div><div class="calc-fields"><div class="calc-field"><label for="bmiH">Height · cm</label><input id="bmiH" type="number" min="100" max="250" value="175"></div><div class="calc-field"><label for="bmiW">Weight · kg</label><input id="bmiW" type="number" min="30" max="350" value="72"></div></div><button class="btn btn-fire calc-run" type="button" onclick="ccaBmi()">Calculate BMI</button><div class="calc-result" id="bmiResult"></div></article>
    <article class="fitness-calculator"><div class="fitness-calculator__head"><span class="fitness-calculator__icon">⌁</span><div><h3>Calorie target · TDEE</h3><p>Mifflin–St Jeor maintenance and goal calories.</p></div></div><div class="calc-fields"><div class="calc-field"><label for="tAge">Age</label><input id="tAge" type="number" min="15" max="100" value="28"></div><div class="calc-field"><label for="tSex">Sex</label><select id="tSex"><option value="m">Male</option><option value="f">Female</option></select></div><div class="calc-field"><label for="tH">Height · cm</label><input id="tH" type="number" value="175"></div><div class="calc-field"><label for="tW">Weight · kg</label><input id="tW" type="number" value="72"></div><div class="calc-field"><label for="tAct">Activity</label><select id="tAct"><option value="1.2">Sedentary</option><option value="1.375">Light</option><option value="1.55" selected>Moderate</option><option value="1.725">Very active</option></select></div><div class="calc-field"><label for="tGoal">Goal</label><select id="tGoal"><option value="-400">Fat loss</option><option value="0" selected>Maintain</option><option value="250">Lean gain</option></select></div></div><button class="btn btn-fire calc-run" type="button" onclick="ccaTdee()">Build calorie target</button><div class="calc-result" id="tdeeResult"></div></article>
    <article class="fitness-calculator"><div class="fitness-calculator__head"><span class="fitness-calculator__icon">◫</span><div><h3>Macro split</h3><p>Protein, carbs and fats matched to your goal.</p></div></div><div class="calc-fields"><div class="calc-field"><label for="mCals">Daily calories</label><input id="mCals" type="number" min="1000" max="7000" value="2400"></div><div class="calc-field"><label for="mGoal">Goal</label><select id="mGoal"><option value="cut">Fat loss</option><option value="maintain" selected>Maintain</option><option value="gain">Lean gain</option></select></div></div><button class="btn btn-fire calc-run" type="button" onclick="ccaMacro()">Calculate macros</button><div class="calc-result" id="macroResult"></div></article>
    <article class="fitness-calculator"><div class="fitness-calculator__head"><span class="fitness-calculator__icon">≈</span><div><h3>Hydration target</h3><p>Daily fluids, including exercise adjustment.</p></div></div><div class="calc-fields"><div class="calc-field"><label for="waterW">Weight · kg</label><input id="waterW" type="number" min="30" max="350" value="72"></div><div class="calc-field"><label for="waterMin">Training · mins</label><input id="waterMin" type="number" min="0" max="300" value="45"></div></div><button class="btn btn-fire calc-run" type="button" onclick="ccaWater()">Calculate hydration</button><div class="calc-result" id="waterResult"></div></article>
    <article class="fitness-calculator"><div class="fitness-calculator__head"><span class="fitness-calculator__icon">↕</span><div><h3>Ideal weight range</h3><p>Devine estimate and healthy BMI range.</p></div></div><div class="calc-fields"><div class="calc-field"><label for="idealH">Height · cm</label><input id="idealH" type="number" min="120" max="230" value="175"></div><div class="calc-field"><label for="idealSex">Sex</label><select id="idealSex"><option value="m">Male</option><option value="f">Female</option></select></div></div><button class="btn btn-fire calc-run" type="button" onclick="ccaIdeal()">Show weight range</button><div class="calc-result" id="idealResult"></div></article>
    <article class="fitness-calculator"><div class="fitness-calculator__head"><span class="fitness-calculator__icon">◌</span><div><h3>Body fat estimate</h3><p>US Navy circumference method.</p></div></div><div class="calc-fields"><div class="calc-field"><label for="bfSex">Sex</label><select id="bfSex"><option value="m">Male</option><option value="f">Female</option></select></div><div class="calc-field"><label for="bfH">Height · cm</label><input id="bfH" type="number" value="175"></div><div class="calc-field"><label for="bfWaist">Waist · cm</label><input id="bfWaist" type="number" value="82"></div><div class="calc-field"><label for="bfNeck">Neck · cm</label><input id="bfNeck" type="number" value="38"></div><div class="calc-field span-2"><label for="bfHip">Hip · cm (female only)</label><input id="bfHip" type="number" value="98"></div></div><button class="btn btn-fire calc-run" type="button" onclick="ccaBodyFat()">Estimate body fat</button><div class="calc-result" id="bodyFatResult"></div></article>
    <article class="fitness-calculator"><div class="fitness-calculator__head"><span class="fitness-calculator__icon">↗</span><div><h3>One-rep max</h3><p>Estimate your Epley 1RM for strength planning.</p></div></div><div class="calc-fields"><div class="calc-field"><label for="rmWeight">Load · kg</label><input id="rmWeight" type="number" min="1" value="60"></div><div class="calc-field"><label for="rmReps">Repetitions</label><input id="rmReps" type="number" min="1" max="20" value="8"></div></div><button class="btn btn-fire calc-run" type="button" onclick="ccaOneRm()">Estimate 1RM</button><div class="calc-result" id="oneRmResult"></div></article>
    <article class="fitness-calculator"><div class="fitness-calculator__head"><span class="fitness-calculator__icon">♥</span><div><h3>Heart-rate zones</h3><p>Personal cardio zones with heart-rate reserve.</p></div></div><div class="calc-fields"><div class="calc-field"><label for="hrAge">Age</label><input id="hrAge" type="number" min="15" max="100" value="28"></div><div class="calc-field"><label for="hrRest">Resting HR · bpm</label><input id="hrRest" type="number" min="35" max="110" value="60"></div></div><button class="btn btn-fire calc-run" type="button" onclick="ccaHeartRate()">Build zones</button><div class="calc-result" id="heartResult"></div></article>
  </div>
  <p class="calc-note"><b>Health note:</b> These tools are educational estimates, not diagnosis or medical advice. Pregnancy, medication, cardiovascular conditions, diabetes, eating disorders or recent injury need individual guidance from a licensed professional.</p>
